BATHRON website and documentation — license status
==================================================

Copyright (c) 2026 the BATHRON project (contact@bathron.org).

- Prose content of the website and documentation (docs/src, index.html):
  all rights reserved for now. A permissive content license may be adopted
  later by an explicit project decision; nothing in this repository should
  be taken as granting content-reuse rights in the meantime.
- Code snippets embedded in the documentation (build commands, configuration
  examples): provided for direct use with the BATHRON software, under the
  same terms as that software (MIT — see bathron-core/COPYING).
- Third-party assets retain their own licenses.

This file exists to make the licensing status EXPLICIT rather than absent;
it deliberately grants nothing beyond snippet use.
